{"title":"Walk and Salmon watching (Free or Paid Event))","startsAt":"2026-10-10T15:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-10T18:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Salmons are expected to be swimming upstream. An annual upward migration. We will spend some time to watch at a few spots and then continue with our walk and return back to the starting point. We will wait until 3:10pm and start walking. If you arrive late, pls follow the Humber River Trail heading north and you can catch up with the group.\n\nDistance: 7 to 9km\n\nDifficulty: Very Easy\n\nTrail: Flat Paved Trail\n\n**Transport**\nRecommend taking TTC or Uber.\n\n**TTC**: Get off Old Mill station and walk to the park.\n\n**Parking**: There is Paid & Free Parking available nearby meeting spot. Pls look up if you are driving.\n\n**Event Fee\\***\nFree if you RSVP before Sep16\n$1.99 if you RSVP on/after Sep17\n\n**Cash** - *In person when you arrive at event*\n**Etransfer-** *[themoja@outlook.com](http://mailto:themoja@outlook.com/) --> use password **meetup***\n**Credit Card**- *[Click here to pay via Stripe](https://buy.stripe.com/bJeeVd3li4Cq3rS7Gh0oM00)*\n\n💬 **Stay Connected:**\n***Join Whatsapp Group - [CLICK HERE](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSflzD3fDrU5sLARAT5yDF3OhEu3Vj-2P7ci8mP5FYX46rt1NQ/viewform)***\n***Follow on Instagram - [CLICK HERE](https://www.instagram.com/tam.club/)***\n\n\\**Signing up in advance helps us plan better. If you’d like to join without registering, there is a $15 drop-in fee. Pls bring exact amount in cash.*","venue":{"name":"Etienne Brule Park","address":"13 Crosby Ave, Toronto","lat":43.652554,"lng":-79.49188,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Toronto Asian Meetup - TAM","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/1/0/f/0/highres_523744336.jpeg"}